 with  federal dollars on immigration and what  our kids should learn in school  we don't want to be told by the federal  government what to do and that's really  why  states and what you're seeing here are  beginning to come together and work  together to push back we'll take a break  we've got a lot more to talk about we  will discuss  the issue of law and order we'll discuss  election integrity  what the republican party needs to do if  they want to win in 2022 and 2024  as we continue we're talking to the  republican governors association more  with them as we continue on this  hannity town hall nashville tennessee  thank you for being with us  hey sean hannity here hey click here to  subscribe to fox news youtube page  and catch our hottest interviews and  most compelling analysis  you will not get it anywhere else

